    dwciri:substrate ENVO:00001995 ;
    dwc:habitat "This species lives attached to rocks, coral rubble, submerged lumber, or mangrove roots, often between 0.5–22.0 m. It is commonly observed forming aggregations as a result of asexual reproduction by pedal laceration (González-Muñoz et al. 2012)."@en ;
    prov:qualifiedDerivation <https://w3id.org/anemone-kg/habitat/e93be5cd-e496-5aa1-b934-6dfbd43ffcd4#derivation> ;
